  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Deer Warrior holds a long spear and buys time with his life for Spirit Spring Forest’s inhabitants while Fang Yuan, as Bull-headed Demon God, crosses the forest and destroys countless gigantic trees. Deer Warrior’s neck is snapped and he dies there.",
      "chapters": [
        1688
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): the world-map landmark uses the short label Spirit Spring, drops Forest, and wires this page to Southern Border. That pin and short label are site map convention. Spirit Spring Forest sits inside Beast Calamity grotto-heaven, not on Southern Border ground.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "loc_beast_calamity_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Combat Beast King names Spirit Spring Forest with Sacred Eagle City and Dark Valley as places the Bull-headed Demon God has already destroyed. Fang Yuan, in that monster form, has destroyed three locations and taken inheritances left by Beast Calamity grotto-heaven’s original owner. Combat Beast Warriors in the hall name Eagle Warrior and Deer Warrior as victims who died at the monster’s hands.",
      "chapters": [
        1688
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "in-beast-calamity-grotto-heaven",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_combat_beast_king",
        "loc_sacred_eagle_city",
        "loc_dark_valley",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_eagle_warrior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After annexing Beast Calamity grotto-heaven, Fang Yuan splits its major gathering spots. Some of those spots hold a portion of Beast Calamity grotto-heaven’s true inheritance. He places Spirit Spring Forest in Mini Central Continent among that set, with Sacred Eagle City, Dark Valley, Mountain Cliff City, and Star Collection City sent to other mini regions.",
      "chapters": [
        1919
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "forest-relocation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_beast_calamity_true_inheritance",
        "loc_mini_central_continent",
        "loc_mountain_cliff_city",
        "loc_star_collection_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a later crisis across Fang Yuan’s five regions, Mini Central Continent’s spirit spring forest is among the small resource points heavily damaged.",
      "chapters": [
        2048
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "resource-damage",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
